<title>USA: Paradigm Technology names CFO.</title>
<headline>Paradigm Technology names CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paradigm Technology Inc, a designer and seller of static random access memory semiconductors, said Monday it had named David Campbell as vice president of finance and chief financial officer, replacing Douglas Schirle.</p>
<p>Schirle resigned due to health reasons earlier in April.</p>
<p>For the last year, Campbell was vice president of finance and administration for Image Quest Technologies Inc, Paradigm said.</p>
